Contract: `ReadRecords` must accept newline-delimited records up to 1 MiB each and return a scanner error for I/O errors. The implementation is:

```go
func ReadRecords(r io.Reader) ([]string, error) {
    s := bufio.NewScanner(r)
    var records []string
    for s.Scan() {
        records = append(records, s.Text())
    }
    if err := s.Err(); err != nil {
        return nil, err
    }
    return records, nil
}
```

Does this meet the contract? If not, name the bug and give the minimal fix.
